# git 行尾与二进制属性
# 不强制 eol=lf：仓库已有文件混合提交过，强制归一化会产生整库 diff 噪音。
# text=auto 让 git 按内容自动判定，Windows 检出时仍用 CRLF，不改变现有工作副本。
* text=auto

# 二进制资源：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary

# 文本类型显式声明，避免个别扩展名被误判
*.cpp text
*.cc text
*.c text
*.h text
*.hpp text
*.cmake text
*.txt text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.iss text
*.in text
*.ps1 text
*.rc text
CMakeLists.txt text
.gitignore text
.gitattributes text
.editorconfig text
.clang-format text
.clang-tidy text

# GitHub 语言统计：third_party 与测试夹具不计入主语言占比
third_party/** linguist-vendored
tests/fixtures/** linguist-vendored
